# ADU bytes: the 7 byte MBAP header (transaction id, protocol id, length, unit id), then the PDU.
# Serialized by the S04b adapter (crates/stonecrab/tests/modbus_driver_suite_adapter.rs) from the XML model of the step "Send Modbus Input-Register Write Request" of test case "Array element write request" in fixtures/modbus/upstream/tcp/DriverTestsuite.xml (Apache PLC4X v1.0.0, commit ea229918), following modbus.mspec; Stonecrab's codec is not involved, and a test re-runs the adapter and compares this file byte for byte.
# Transaction 1, protocol id 0, length 15 (unit id plus 14 PDU bytes), unit id 1. Function 0x10 (write multiple registers) request: start 0, quantity 4, byte count 8.
00 01 00 00 00 0F 01 10 00 00 00 04 08 40 49 0F DB 40 49 0F DB
